ph Key Type Type This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a derived type to the parent type which it\nextends. Dashed arrows point from a derived type to the other\ntypes it contains as a components, with a label listing the name(s) of\nsaid component(s). Components Type Visibility Attributes Name Initial type(c_ptr), public :: handle = c_null_ptr the window's GUI in the C++ layer (null: none) Type-Bound Procedures procedure, public :: begin_panel private  subroutine begin_panel (self, title, position, pivot, follow) A panel titled title ('##name': no title bar), with the widgets up to end_panel . position ([x, y], 0 to 1 across the window, y up; default:\nwhere ImGui puts it) is where its point pivot is ([0, 0], the default:\nits top left; [0.5, 1]: the middle of its bottom); with follow , every\nframe (and it can't be moved), else at first. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( Gui ), intent(inout) :: self character(len=*), intent(in) :: title real(kind=wp), intent(in), optional :: position (2) [x, y] (0 to 1 across the window, y up) real(kind=wp), intent(in), optional :: pivot (2) the panel's point at position (0 to 1, from its top left) logical, intent(in), optional :: follow place it every frame (default false: at first) procedure, public :: button private  function button (self, label) A button: true once after it was clicked. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( Gui ), intent(inout) :: self character(len=*), intent(in) :: label Return Value logical procedure, public :: checkbox private  function checkbox (self, label, value) result(changed) A checkbox showing value : true (and value changed) after the user\nchanged it. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( Gui ), intent(inout) :: self character(len=*), intent(in) :: label logical, intent(inout) :: value Return Value logical procedure, public :: combo private  function combo (self, label, index, items) result(changed) A combo box (a drop-dow