ajectory Trajectory type~trajectorypointer->type~trajectory p Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Type Type This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a derived type to the parent type which it\nextends. Dashed arrows point from a derived type to the other\ntypes it contains as a components, with a label listing the name(s) of\nsaid component(s). Components Type Visibility Attributes Name Initial type( MapLayer ), private, allocatable :: layers (:) (capacity): the layers, in the order added logical, private :: lighting_ = .true. lit by the scene's lights type(c_ptr), private :: map = c_null_ptr Rocky's map node (null: not made) type(c_ptr), private :: map_group = c_null_ptr the group the map is in (once shown) integer, private :: n_layers = 0 number of layers character(len=:), private, allocatable :: profile_ Rocky's tiling profile ('': the Earth) real(kind=wp), private :: units_per_meter_ = 1.0e-3_wp scene units per meter Constructor public        interface TerrainBody The TerrainBody constructor: TerrainBody(...) makes one (see new_terrain_body for its\narguments). private  function new_terrain_body (name, profile, units_per_meter, color) result(b) A body named name in Rocky's tiling profile profile (default '':\nthe Earth; 'moon': the Moon), drawn at units_per_meter scene units per\nmeter (default 1e-3), in color color where it has no imagery ([r, g, b]\nor [r, g, b, a]; default the frame's). Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name character(len=*), intent(in) :: name character(len=*), intent(in), optional :: profile Rocky's tiling profile (default '') real(kind=wp), intent(in), optional :: units_per_meter scene units per meter (default 1e-3) real(kind=wp), intent(in), optional :: color (:) [r, g, b] or [r, g, b, a] (0 to 1) Return Value type( TerrainBody ) Type-Bound Procedures procedure, public :: add_child private  function add_child (self, child) result(ok) Add child to this frame's children. 