ne","tags":"","url":"type/ellipticcone.html"},{"title":"LatLonGrid – vkframes ","text":"type, public, extends( ReferenceFrame ) :: LatLonGrid Latitude and longitude lines on an ellipsoid (OpenFrames' LatLonGrid):\nat geodetic latitudes (matching a Sphere's texture), every lat_spacing from the equator and every lon_spacing from the prime meridian (the\nequator and prime meridian thicker), in the frame's color. Inherits type~~latlongrid~~InheritsGraph type~latlongrid LatLonGrid type~referenceframe ReferenceFrame type~latlongrid->type~referenceframe type~shapenodes ShapeNodes type~latlongrid->type~shapenodes nodes c_ptr c_ptr type~referenceframe->c_ptr light_node, light_switch, node_, contents_node, axis_node, axis_label_node, axis_arrow, axis_text, name_label_node, name_text type~framepointer FramePointer type~referenceframe->type~framepointer children, parents type~trajectoryfollower TrajectoryFollower type~referenceframe->type~trajectoryfollower follower_ type~shapenodes->c_ptr contents, shape type~framepointer->type~referenceframe p type~datasource DataSource type~trajectoryfollower->type~datasource sources_ type~trajectorypointer TrajectoryPointer type~trajectoryfollower->type~trajectorypointer trajs type~trajectory Trajectory type~trajectorypointer->type~trajectory p Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Type Type This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a derived type to the parent type which it\nextends. Dashed arrows point from a derived type to the other\ntypes it contains as a components, with a label listing the name(s) of\nsaid component(s). Components Type Visibility Attributes Name Initial real(kind=wp), private :: lat_spacing = 30.0_wp*pi/180.0_wp between latitude lines (radians; 0: none) real(kind=wp), private :: lon_spacing = 30.0_wp*pi/180.0_wp between meridians (radians; 0: none) real(kind=wp), private :: main_width = 3.0_wp equator's and prime meridian's width (window units) type( ShapeNod