nly those that changed since the last sync). Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( ReferenceFrame ), intent(inout) :: self procedure, public :: two_sided private pure function two_sided (self) Whether both sides are drawn. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( Polyhedron ), intent(in) :: self Return Value logical procedure, public :: unfollow private  subroutine unfollow (self) Stop following trajectories (the frame keeps its last position and attitude). Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( ReferenceFrame ), intent(inout) :: self procedure, public :: update private recursive subroutine update (self, t) Update this frame and its descendants for simulation time t (followed\ntrajectories set positions and attitudes). Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( ReferenceFrame ), intent(inout) :: self real(kind=wp), intent(in) :: t simulation time procedure, public :: world_matrix private recursive function world_matrix (self) result(m) The transform from this frame to the root of its tree, through the first\nparent at each level. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( ReferenceFrame ), intent(in) :: self Return Value real(kind=wp), (4,4) Source Code type , extends ( ReferenceFrame ), public :: Polyhedron private real ( wp ), allocatable :: v (:,:) !! vertices (3, n), frame coordinates integer , allocatable :: tri (:,:) !! triangles (3, m), vertex numbers (1-based) integer , allocatable :: edge (:,:) !! edges (2, k), vertex numbers real ( wp ), allocatable :: vertex_colors_ (:,:) !! a color per vertex (4, n) (none: the face color) real ( wp ) :: face_color_ ( 4 ) = 1.0_wp !! faces' color [r, g, b, a] real ( wp ) :: line_color_ ( 4 ) = 1.0_wp !! edges' color real ( wp ) :: point_color_ ( 4 ) = 1.0_wp !! vertices' color real ( wp ) :: opacity_ = 1.0_wp !! the faces' (times their colors' alpha) real ( wp ) :: width_ = 1.0_wp !! edges' width (window units) real ( wp ) :: point_size_ = 6.0_wp !! vertice