e and its descendants to\ntheir transform nodes (only those that changed since the last sync). Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( ReferenceFrame ), intent(inout) :: self procedure, public :: unfollow private  subroutine unfollow (self) Stop following trajectories (the frame keeps its last position and attitude). Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( ReferenceFrame ), intent(inout) :: self procedure, public :: update private recursive subroutine update (self, t) Update this frame and its descendants for simulation time t (followed\ntrajectories set positions and attitudes). Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( ReferenceFrame ), intent(inout) :: self real(kind=wp), intent(in) :: t simulation time procedure, public :: world_matrix private recursive function world_matrix (self) result(m) The transform from this frame to the root of its tree, through the first\nparent at each level. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( ReferenceFrame ), intent(in) :: self Return Value real(kind=wp), (4,4) Source Code type , extends ( ReferenceFrame ), public :: RadialPlane private real ( wp ) :: radius_ = 1.0_wp !! the disk's radius (scene units) real ( wp ) :: radial_spacing = 0.5_wp !! between circles (scene units; 0: none) real ( wp ) :: lon_spacing = 3 0.0_wp * pi / 18 0.0_wp !! between radial lines (radians; 0: none) real ( wp ) :: plane_color_ ( 4 ) = [ 0.8_wp , 0.8_wp , 0.8_wp , 0.2_wp ] !! the disk's color [r, g, b, a] real ( wp ) :: line_color_ ( 4 ) = [ 1.0_wp , 1.0_wp , 1.0_wp , 0.2_wp ] !! circles' and radial lines' color [r, g, b, a] type ( ShapeNodes ) :: nodes !! the drawing contains procedure :: set_parameters => plane_set_parameters , parameters => plane_parameters procedure :: set_plane_color , plane_color procedure :: set_line_color => plane_set_line_color , line_color => plane_line_color procedure :: frame_info => plane_frame_info procedure :: bound => plane_bound procedure :: build_contents => plane_build_contents end type RadialPlane","tags":"","url":"type/radialplane.html"},{"title":"RectangularCone – vkframes ","text":"type, public, extends( PolyhedralCone ) :: RectangularCone A rectangular cone (OpenFrames' RectangularCone): half-angles x and y\n( set_primary_angles ; default 60 and 30 degrees). Inherits type~~rectangularcone~~InheritsGraph type~rectangularcone RectangularCone type~polyhedralcone PolyhedralCone type~rectangularcone->type~polyhedralcone type~referenceframe ReferenceFrame type~polyhedralcone->type~referenceframe type~shapenodes ShapeNodes type~polyhedralcone->type~shapenodes nodes c_ptr c_ptr type~referenceframe->c_ptr light_node, light_switch, node_, contents_node, axis_node, axis_label_node, axis_arrow, axis_text, name_label_node, name_text type~framepointer FramePointer type~referenceframe->type~framepointer children, parents type~trajectoryfollower TrajectoryFollower type~referenceframe->type~trajectoryfollower follower_ type~shapenodes->c_ptr contents, shape type~framepointer->type~referenceframe p type~datasource DataSource type~trajectoryfollower->type~datasource sources_ type~trajectorypointer TrajectoryPointer type~trajectoryfollower->type~trajectorypointer trajs type~trajectory Trajectory type~trajectorypointer->type~trajectory p Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Type Type This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a derived type to the parent type which it\nextends. Dashed arrows point from a derived type to the other\ntypes it contains as a components, with a label listing the name(s) of\nsaid component(s). Components Type Visibility Attributes Name Initial real(kind=wp), private :: x = 60.0_wp*pi/180.0_wp half-angle along x (radians) real(kind=wp), private :: y = 30.0_wp*pi/180.0_wp half-angle along y (radians) Constructor public        interface RectangularCone The RectangularCone constructor: RectangularCone(...) makes one (see new_rectangular_cone for its\nargument