ric interface or the\nimplementation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module. Source Code subroutine curve_style ( self ) class ( CurveArtist ), intent ( inout ) :: self real ( wp ) :: rgba ( 4 ) rgba = self % color_ if ( self % chain % is_colored ()) rgba = 1.0_wp call self % chain % set_style ( rgba , self % width_ ) call self % chain % set_pattern ( self % pattern_factor , self % pattern_ ) call apply_highlight ( self % highlight_ , self % chain ) if ( c_associated ( self % tail )) call self % chain % style_node ( self % tail ) end subroutine curve_style","tags":"","url":"proc/curve_style.html"},{"title":"curve_update – vkframes","text":"private  subroutine curve_update(self, t) Write the points added (all of them on a redraw), and draw them all, or\nin trace mode those passed and the tail to the point at time t, or with\na trail the window about time t. Type Bound CurveArtist Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( CurveArtist ), intent(inout) :: self real(kind=wp), intent(in) :: t the current time Calls proc~~curve_update~~CallsGraph proc~curve_update CurveArtist%curve_update proc~draw_trail draw_trail proc~curve_update->proc~draw_trail proc~draw_written draw_written proc~curve_update->proc~draw_written proc~write_changed write_changed proc~curve_update->proc~write_changed distance distance proc~draw_trail->distance draw_range draw_range proc~draw_trail->draw_range interface~vkf_line_set_range vkf_line_set_range proc~draw_trail->interface~vkf_line_set_range proc~check_status check_status proc~draw_trail->proc~check_status proc~decreasing_times decreasing_times proc~draw_trail->proc~decreasing_times set_trail set_trail proc~draw_trail->set_trail draw_tail draw_tail proc~draw_written->draw_tail proc~draw_written->interface~vkf_line_set_range proc~chain_points_per_point chain_points_per_point proc~draw_written->proc~chain_points_per_point proc~draw_written->proc~check_status proc~draw LineChain%draw proc~draw_written->proc~draw proc~draw_ra