elf % point_colors_ ) return self % point_colors_ = enabled call rebuild_markers ( self ) end subroutine marker_set_point_colors","tags":"","url":"proc/marker_set_point_colors.html"},{"title":"marker_set_trajectory – vkframes","text":"private  subroutine marker_set_trajectory(self, traj) Draw traj ; with the default data sources, its positions (per its DOF). Type Bound MarkerArtist Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( MarkerArtist ), intent(inout) :: self type( Trajectory ), intent(in), target :: traj Calls proc~~marker_set_trajectory~~CallsGraph proc~marker_set_trajectory MarkerArtist%marker_set_trajectory proc~dof Trajectory%dof proc~marker_set_trajectory->proc~dof proc~position_sources position_sources proc~marker_set_trajectory->proc~position_sources Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Procedure Type Bound Procedure Unknown Procedure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interface to procedures which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplementation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module. Called by proc~~marker_set_trajectory~~CalledByGraph proc~marker_set_trajectory MarkerArtist%marker_set_trajectory proc~new_marker_artist new_marker_artist proc~new_marker_artist->proc~marker_set_trajectory interface~markerartist MarkerArtist interface~markerartist->proc~new_marker_artist Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Procedure Type Bound Procedure Unknown Procedure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from 