om a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interface to procedures which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplementation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module. Called by proc~~remove_artist~~CalledByGraph proc~remove_artist DrawableTrajectory%remove_artist proc~remove_all_artists DrawableTrajectory%remove_all_artists proc~remove_all_artists->proc~remove_artist Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Procedure Type Bound Procedure Unknown Procedure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interface to procedures which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplementation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module. Source Code subroutine remove_artist ( self , a ) class ( DrawableTrajectory ), intent ( inout ) :: self class ( TrajectoryArtist ), intent ( in ), target :: a integer :: k do k = 1 , self % n_artists if ( associated ( self % artists ( k )% p , a )) then if ( c_associated ( self % artists ( k )% group )) then call check_status ( vkf_node_remove_child ( self % contents_group , self % artists ( k )% group ), 'trajectory artists' ) call vkf_node_delete ( self % artists ( k )% group ) call self % artists ( k )% p % release () end if self % artists ( k : self % n_artists - 1 ) = self % artists ( k + 1 : self % n_artists ) self % n_artists = self % n_artists - 1 return end if end do end subroutine remove_artist","tags":"","url":"proc/remove_artist.html"},{"title":"remove_trail – vkframes","text":"private  subroutine remove_trail(self) No trail: the whole curve (or trace mode, if set) again. Type Bound CurveArtist Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name cla