 Attributes Name class( WindowProxy ), intent(inout) :: self type( HUDText ), intent(in), target :: h Calls proc~~remove_hud_text~~CallsGraph proc~remove_hud_text WindowProxy%remove_hud_text interface~vkf_node_delete vkf_node_delete proc~remove_hud_text->interface~vkf_node_delete interface~vkf_viewer_hud_remove vkf_viewer_hud_remove proc~remove_hud_text->interface~vkf_viewer_hud_remove Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Procedure Type Bound Procedure Unknown Procedure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interface to procedures which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplementation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module. Source Code subroutine remove_hud_text ( self , h ) class ( WindowProxy ), intent ( inout ) :: self type ( HUDText ), intent ( in ), target :: h integer ( c_int ) :: status integer :: k do k = 1 , self % n_huds if (. not . associated ( self % huds ( k )% p , h )) cycle if ( c_associated ( self % huds ( k )% node )) then status = vkf_viewer_hud_remove ( self % viewer_ , self % huds ( k )% node ) ! (not shown yet: -1) call vkf_node_delete ( self % huds ( k )% node ) end if self % huds ( k : self % n_huds - 1 ) = self % huds ( k + 1 : self % n_huds ) self % n_huds = self % n_huds - 1 return end do end subroutine remove_hud_text","tags":"","url":"proc/remove_hud_text.html"},{"title":"remove_view – vkframes","text":"private  subroutine remove_view(self, v) Remove all instances of v from the window's views. Type Bound WindowProxy Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( WindowProxy ), intent(inout) :: self type( View ), intent(in), target :: v Source Code subroutine remove_view ( self , v ) class ( WindowProxy ), intent ( ino