t (window units) self % size_ = size self % revision_ = self % revision_ + 1 end subroutine set_size !> The size of the text: character height (window units). pure real ( wp ) function size ( self ) class ( HUDText ), intent ( in ) :: self size = self % size_ end function size !> [r, g, b] (alpha unchanged) or [r, g, b, a], 0 to 1. subroutine set_color ( self , color ) class ( HUDText ), intent ( inout ) :: self real ( wp ), intent ( in ) :: color (:) integer :: n n = min ( 4 , ubound ( color , 1 )) self % color_ ( 1 : n ) = color ( 1 : n ) self % revision_ = self % revision_ + 1 end subroutine set_color !> The color: [r, g, b, a] (0 to 1). pure function color ( self ) result ( c ) class ( HUDText ), intent ( in ) :: self real ( wp ) :: c ( 4 ) c = self % color_ end function color","tags":"","url":"proc/color~2.html"},{"title":"font – vkframes","text":"private  function font(self) result(f) The font file ('' for the default font). Type Bound HUDText Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( HUDText ), intent(in) :: self Return Value character(len=:), allocatable Called by proc~~font~~CalledByGraph proc~font HUDText%font proc~create_hud create_hud proc~create_hud->proc~font proc~update_huds update_huds proc~update_huds->proc~font proc~update_huds->proc~create_hud proc~add_hud_text WindowProxy%add_hud_text proc~add_hud_text->proc~create_hud proc~create_huds create_huds proc~create_huds->proc~create_hud proc~frame WindowProxy%frame proc~frame->proc~update_huds proc~frame->proc~create_huds proc~resize WindowProxy%resize proc~resize->proc~frame proc~run WindowProxy%run proc~run->proc~frame Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Procedure Type Bound Procedure Unknown Procedure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interfac