ontents->proc~name proc~update_model_transform update_model_transform proc~model_build_contents->proc~update_model_transform proc~update_model_transform->proc~name interface~vkf_transform_set_matrix vkf_transform_set_matrix proc~update_model_transform->interface~vkf_transform_set_matrix proc~frame_matrix frame_matrix proc~update_model_transform->proc~frame_matrix proc~quat_to_matrix quat_to_matrix proc~frame_matrix->proc~quat_to_matrix Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Procedure Type Bound Procedure Unknown Procedure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interface to procedures which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplementation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module. Source Code subroutine model_build_contents ( self , viewer , group ) class ( Model ), intent ( inout ) :: self type ( c_ptr ), intent ( in ) :: viewer !! a window's viewer handle (null: headless) type ( c_ptr ), intent ( in ) :: group !! the group node to build under if (. not . c_associated ( self % model_ )) return self % model_node = vkf_transform_create () call update_model_transform ( self ) if ( vkf_node_add_child ( self % model_node , self % model_ ) /= 0 . or . vkf_node_add_child ( group , self % model_node ) /= 0 ) & write ( * , '(a)' ) 'vkframes: Model ' // self % name () // ': could not build the scene' end subroutine model_build_contents","tags":"","url":"proc/model_build_contents.html"},{"title":"model_frame_bound – vkframes","text":"private  subroutine model_frame_bound(self, center, radius) The model's bounding sphere in the frame (through the model transform). Type Bound Model Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( Model ), intent(in) :: self real(kind=wp), intent(out) :: center (3) real(kind=wp), intent(out) :: radius Calls proc~~model_frame_bound~~CallsGraph proc~model_frame_bound Model%model_frame_bound proc~frame_matrix frame_matrix proc~model_frame_bound->proc~frame_matrix proc~quat_to_matrix quat_to_matrix proc~frame_matrix->proc~quat_to_matrix Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Procedure Type Bound Procedure Unknown Procedure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interface to procedures which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplementation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module. Called by proc~~model_frame_bound~~CalledByGraph proc~model_frame_bound Model%model_frame_bound proc~model_pick Model%model_pick proc~model_pick->proc~model_frame_bound Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Procedure Type Bound Procedure Unknown Procedure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interface to procedures which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplementation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module. Source Code subroutine model_frame_bound ( self , center , radius ) class ( Model ), intent ( in ) :: self real ( wp ), intent ( out ) :: center ( 3 ), radius real ( wp ) :: m ( 4 , 4 ) m = frame_matrix ( self % model_position_ , self % model_attitude_ , self % scale_ , self % pivot_ ) center = matmul ( m ( 1 : 3 , 1 : 3 ), self % bound_center ) + m ( 1 : 3 , 4 ) radius = self % bound_radius * maxval ( abs ( self % scale_ )) end subroutine model_frame_bound","tags":"","url":"proc/model_frame_bound.html"},{"title":"model_pick – vkframes","text":"private  subroutine model_pick(self, cam, to_root, hits, n) Picked on the model's bounding sphere (not its triangles); else at the\nframe's origin. Type Bound Model Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( Model ), intent(in), target :: self type( PickCamera ), intent(in) :: cam the cursor's ray and the pick's settings real(kind=wp), intent(in) :: to_root (4,4) the frame's transform to the root frame type( PickHit ), intent(inout), allocatable :: hits (:) hits so far (grown as needed) integer, intent(inout) :: n number of hits in hits Calls proc~~model_pick~~CallsGraph proc~model_pick Model%model_pick proc~contents_shown ReferenceFrame%contents_shown proc~model_pick->proc~contents_shown proc~identity_matrix identity_matrix proc~model_pick->proc~identity_matrix proc~model_frame_bound Model%model_frame_bound proc~model_pick->proc~model_frame_bound proc~pick ReferenceFrame%pick proc~model_pick->proc~pick proc~pick_ellipsoid pick_ellipsoid proc~model_pick->proc~pick_ellipsoid proc~frame_matrix frame_matrix proc~model_frame_bound->proc~frame_matrix proc~add_pick_hit add_pick_hit proc~pick->proc~add_pick_hit proc~point_pick point_pick proc~pick->proc~point_pick proc~wants wants proc~pick->proc~wants proc~pick_ellipsoid->proc~add_pick_hit proc~ray ray proc~pick_ellipsoid->proc~ray proc~ray_ellipsoid ray_ellipsoid proc~pick_ellipsoid->proc~ray_ellipsoid proc~pick_ellipsoid->proc~wants proc~quat_to_matrix quat_to_matrix proc~frame_matrix->proc~quat_to_matrix proc~project project proc~point_pick->proc~project Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Procedure Type Bound Procedure Unknown Procedure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interface to procedures which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplementation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module. Source Code subroutine model_pick ( self , cam , to_root , hits , n ) class ( Model ), intent ( in ), target :: self type ( PickCamera ), intent ( in ) :: cam !! the cursor's ray and the pick's settings real ( wp ), intent ( in ) :: to_root ( 4 , 4 ) !! the frame's transform to the root frame type ( PickHit ), allocatable , intent ( inout ) :: hits (:) !! hits so far (grown as needed) integer , intent ( inout ) :: n !! number of hits in hits real ( wp ) :: c ( 3 ), r , m ( 4 , 4 ) call self % bound ( c , r ) if ( self % contents_shown () . and . r > 0.0_wp ) then m = identity_matrix () if ( pick_ellipsoid ( self , cam , to_root , c , m ( 1 : 3 , 1 : 3 ), [ r , r , r ], . false ., hits , n )) return end if call self % ReferenceFrame % pick ( cam , to_root , hits , n ) end subroutine model_pick","tags":"","url":"proc/model_pick.html"},{"title":"set_model_attitude – vkframes","text":"private  subroutine set_model_attitude(self, q) Attitude of the model in its frame (quaternion [x, y, z, w]). Type Bound Model Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( Model ), intent(inout) :: self real(kind=wp), intent(in) :: q (4) Calls proc~~set_model_attitude~~CallsGraph proc~set_model_attitude Model%set_model_attitude proc~quat_normalize quat_normalize proc~set_model_attitude->proc~quat_normalize proc~update_model_transform update_model_transform proc~set_model_attitude->proc~update_model_transform interface~vkf_transform_set_matrix vkf_transform_set_matrix proc~update_model_transform->interface~vkf_transform_set_matrix proc~frame_matrix frame_matrix proc~update_model_transform->proc~frame_matrix proc~name ReferenceFrame%name proc~update_model_transform->proc~name proc~quat_to_matrix quat_to_matrix proc~frame_matrix->proc~