tine set_light_specular ( self , rgb ) class ( ReferenceFrame ), intent ( inout ) :: self real ( wp ), intent ( in ) :: rgb ( 3 ) self % light_specular_ = rgb call apply_light ( self ) end subroutine set_light_specular","tags":"","url":"proc/set_light_specular~2.html"},{"title":"set_name – vkframes","text":"private  subroutine set_name(self, name) The frame's name, shown by its name label (also once shown: e.g. a\nreadout that follows the frame). Type Bound ReferenceFrame Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( ReferenceFrame ), intent(inout) :: self character(len=*), intent(in) :: name Calls proc~~set_name~~CallsGraph proc~set_name ReferenceFrame%set_name interface~vkf_label_set_text vkf_label_set_text proc~set_name->interface~vkf_label_set_text proc~check_status check_status proc~set_name->proc~check_status Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Procedure Type Bound Procedure Unknown Procedure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interface to procedures which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplementation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module. Source Code subroutine set_name ( self , name ) class ( ReferenceFrame ), intent ( inout ) :: self character ( len =* ), intent ( in ) :: name self % name_ = name if ( c_associated ( self % name_text )) call check_status ( vkf_label_set_text ( self % name_text , name , len ( name , kind = c_int ))) end subroutine set_name","tags":"","url":"proc/set_name.html"},{"title":"set_name_label_on_top – vkframes","text":"private  subroutine set_name_label_on_top(self, on_top) Draw the name label on top of the scene (true: not hidden by bodies in\nfront of it, as HUD text; e.g. a readout) or depth-tested (