a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interface to procedures which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplementation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module. Source Code subroutine make_axes ( self ) class ( CoordinateAxes ), intent ( inout ) :: self real ( wp ), allocatable :: lines (:,:), major (:,:), minor (:,:) real ( wp ) :: e ( 3 ), mark , f type ( c_ptr ) :: group integer :: k , i if (. not . c_associated ( self % nodes % contents )) return allocate ( lines ( 3 , 0 ), major ( 3 , 0 ), minor ( 3 , 0 )) do k = 1 , 3 if ( iand ( self % drawn , 2 ** ( k - 1 )) == 0 ) cycle e = 0.0_wp e ( k ) = 1.0_wp call append ( lines , reshape ([ 0.0_wp , 0.0_wp , 0.0_wp , self % length_ * e ], [ 3 , 2 ])) if ( self % major > 0.0_wp ) then do i = 1 , int ( self % length_ / self % major + 1.0e-9_wp ) call append ( major , reshape ( i * self % major * e , [ 3 , 1 ])) end do end if if ( self % minor > 0.0_wp ) then do i = 1 , int ( self % length_ / self % minor + 1.0e-9_wp ) mark = i * self % minor if ( self % major > 0.0_wp ) then ! not where a major tick is f = mark / self % major if ( abs ( f - nint ( f )) < 1.0e-6_wp ) cycle end if call append ( minor , reshape ( mark * e , [ 3 , 1 ])) end do end if end do group = vkf_switch_create () call add ( group , line_node ( lines , self % color (), self % width_ , . true .)) call add ( group , marker_node ( major , self % color (), self % major_size , self % shape_ , self % length_ , self % image )) call add ( group , marker_node ( minor , self % color (), self % minor_size , self % shape_ , self % length_ , self % image )) call self % nodes % replace ( group ) end subroutine make_axes","tags":"","url":"proc/make_axes.html"},{"title":"make_cone – vkframes","text":"private  subroutine make_cone(self) Make the sides, edges and base outline (those the draw mode says), in place\nof the old. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name c