raph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Procedure Type Bound Procedure Unknown Procedure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interface to procedures which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplementation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module. Source Code subroutine apply_material_to ( self , mesh ) type ( Sphere ), intent ( in ) :: self type ( c_ptr ), intent ( in ) :: mesh !! a mesh handle (null: nothing done) real ( wp ) :: diffuse ( 4 ) if (. not . c_associated ( mesh )) return diffuse = self % diffuse_ if (. not . self % textured ) diffuse = diffuse * self % color () if ( self % translucent ) diffuse ( 4 ) = diffuse ( 4 ) * self % opacity_ ! (the shader's alpha: the diffuse color's) if ( mesh_set_material ( mesh , real ( self % ambient_ , c_float ), real ( diffuse , c_float ), & real ( self % specular_ , c_float ), real ( self % emission_ , c_float ), & real ( self % shininess_ , c_float )) /= 0 ) & write ( * , '(a)' ) 'vkframes: Sphere ' // self % name () // ': could not set the material' if ( vkf_mesh_set_twilight ( mesh , real ( self % twilight_ , c_float )) /= 0 ) & write ( * , '(a)' ) 'vkframes: Sphere ' // self % name () // ': could not set the twilight' end subroutine apply_material_to","tags":"","url":"proc/apply_material_to.html"},{"title":"build_lod_mesh – vkframes","text":"private  subroutine build_lod_mesh(self, k, compile) Build level-of-detail mesh k (lod_segments(k) segments around) and add it\nto the level-of-detail node (compiled for the windows if compile ). Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name type( Sphere ), intent(inout) :: self integer, intent(in) :: k index into lod_segments logical, intent(in) :: compile Calls proc~~build_lod_mesh~~CallsGraph proc~build_lod_mesh build_lod_mesh interface~vkf_compile_node vkf_compile_node proc~build_lod_mesh->interface~vkf_compile_node interface~vkf_sphere_lod_add vkf_sphere_lod_add proc~build_lod_mesh->interface~vkf_sphere_lod_add proc~apply_material_to apply_material_to proc~build_lod_mesh->proc~apply_material_to proc~ellipsoid_create ellipsoid_create proc~build_lod_mesh->proc~ellipsoid_create proc~name ReferenceFrame%name proc~build_lod_mesh->proc~name proc~apply_material_to->proc~name interface~vkf_mesh_set_twilight vkf_mesh_set_twilight proc~apply_material_to->interface~vkf_mesh_set_twilight proc~color~3 ReferenceFrame%color proc~apply_material_to->proc~color~3 proc~mesh_set_material mesh_set_material proc~apply_material_to->proc~mesh_set_material interface~vkf_mesh_create vkf_mesh_create proc~ellipsoid_create->interface~vkf_mesh_create interface~vkf_mesh_set_bound vkf_mesh_set_bound proc~ellipsoid_create->interface~vkf_mesh_set_bound proc~ellipsoid ellipsoid proc~ellipsoid_create->proc~ellipsoid proc~ellipsoid_size ellipsoid_size proc~ellipsoid_create->proc~ellipsoid_size proc~mesh_arrays mesh_arrays proc~ellipsoid_create->proc~mesh_arrays interface~vkf_mesh_array vkf_mesh_array proc~mesh_arrays->interface~vkf_mesh_array interface~vkf_mesh_material vkf_mesh_material proc~mesh_set_material->interface~vkf_mesh_material interface~vkf_mesh_material_changed vkf_mesh_material_changed proc~mesh_set_material->interface~vkf_mesh_material_changed Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Procedure Type Bound Procedure Unknown Procedure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interface to procedures which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplementation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module. Called by proc~~build_lod_mesh~~CalledByGraph proc~build_lod_mesh build_lod_mesh proc~sphere_build_contents Sphere%sphere_build_contents proc~sphere_build_contents->proc~build_lod_mesh proc~sphere_update Sphere%sphere_update proc~sphere_update->proc~build_lod_mesh Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Procedure Type Bound Procedure Unknown Procedure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interface to procedures which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplementation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module. Source Code subroutine build_lod_mesh ( self , k , compile ) type ( Sphere ), intent ( inout ) :: self integer , intent ( in ) :: k !! index into lod_segments logical , intent ( in ) :: compile type ( c_ptr ) :: mesh mesh = ellipsoid_create ( self % built_radii , [ 1.0_c_float , 1.0_c_float , 1.0_c_float , 1.0_c_float ], self % image , & lod_segments ( k ), lod_segments ( k ) / 2 , self % night , translucent = self % translucent ) if (. not . c_associated ( mesh )) then write ( * , '(a,i0,a)' ) 'vkframes: Sphere ' // self % name () // ': could not build its ' , lod_segments ( k ), '-segment mesh' return end if self % lod_mesh ( k ) = mesh call apply_material_to ( self , mesh ) if ( compile ) then if ( vkf_compile_node ( mesh ) /= 0 ) write ( * , '(a)' ) 'vkframes: Sphere ' // self % name () // ': could not compile a mesh' end if if ( vkf_sphere_lod_add ( self % lod_node , mesh , int ( lod_segments ( k ), c_int )) /= 0 ) & write ( * , '(a)' ) 'vkframes: Sphere ' // self % name () // ': could not add a mesh' end subroutine build_lod_mesh","tags":"","url":"proc/build_lod_mesh.html"},{"title":"material – vkframes","text":"private pure subroutine material(self, ambient, diff