gment artists (see\nCurveArtist%set_highlight; HIGHLIGHT_NONE: none of them). Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( DrawableTrajectory ), intent(inout) :: self integer, intent(in) :: mode HIGHLIGHT_* (added) real(kind=wp), intent(in), optional :: color (:) [r, g, b] or [r, g, b, a] (0 to 1) real(kind=wp), intent(in), optional :: arrow_spacing between arrows (window units; default 40) real(kind=wp), intent(in), optional :: arrow_speed (window units per second; default 50) real(kind=wp), intent(in), optional :: band_width of the arrows' band (window units; default 12) real(kind=wp), intent(in), optional :: pulse_period (s; default 1.5) private recursive subroutine drawable_update (self, t) Update the frame (and its descendants), then its artists. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( DrawableTrajectory ), intent(inout) :: self real(kind=wp), intent(in) :: t private  subroutine drawn_pair (self, i, a, b) The pair at trajectory point i (1 to num_drawn) as drawn, its start a\nand end b: read back from the buffers. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( RibbonArtist ), intent(in) :: self integer, intent(in) :: i real(kind=wp), intent(out) :: a (3) real(kind=wp), intent(out) :: b (3) private  subroutine drawn_segment (self, s, a, b) Segment s (at point 1 + (s-1) stride; first_drawn to first_drawn +\nnum_drawn - 1 drawn) as written: read back from the line buffers. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( SegmentArtist ), intent(in) :: self integer, intent(in) :: s real(kind=wp), intent(out) :: a (3) the segment's start (frame coordinates) real(kind=wp), intent(out) :: b (3) its end private  subroutine intermediates_by_data (self, n) Every int(spacing)-th point after the first, before the last. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name type( MarkerArtist ), intent(inout) :: self integer, intent(in) :: n private  subroutine intermediates_by_distance (self, n) Every spacing of arc length (the points joined by st