parents; adding a child that is an ancestor of the parent is refused. Rendering: when a window first shows a tree ( realize ), each frame gets a\ntransform node, with its contents ( build_contents , which extensions\noverride) under a switch for show_contents ; children's nodes go under the\nparent's transform, so a frame with several parents is drawn under each.\nEach frame, update moves followed frames to the time, then late_update lets contents depend on other frames' positions at that time (e.g.\nCustomLineSegments between spacecraft), and sync copies positions and\nattitudes to the transforms. A shown\ntree can change: children added to a shown frame are realized and compiled\n(for the windows running) and drawn from the next frame;\nremoved ones stop being drawn; moved axes (move_x_axis, ...) are made again. Labels: the name label (at the origin, facing the screen) and the axes'\nlabels can change while shown: the name ( set_name , e.g. a readout that\nfollows the frame), color, label size, alignment and font, and the axes'\nlabel texts. Picking (WindowProxy%pick): each frame tests what it draws against a\nPickCamera (vkf_pick) in its pick procedure, given its transform to the\nroot frame, and adds a PickHit for each thing within reach (the window\nsorts them nearest first). A plain frame is picked at its origin if it\nshows axes or its name label (PICK_FRAME); extensions pick their contents\n(bodies, trajectories). Uses iso_c_binding vkf_text vkf_trajectory vkf_geometry vkf_follower vkf_pick vkf_layer vkf_math module~~vkf_frames~~UsesGraph module~vkf_frames vkf_frames iso_c_binding iso_c_binding module~vkf_frames->iso_c_binding module~vkf_follower vkf_follower module~vkf_frames->module~vkf_follower module~vkf_geometry vkf_geometry module~vkf_frames->module~vkf_geometry module~vkf_layer vkf_layer module~vkf_frames->module~vkf_layer module~vkf_math vkf_math module~vkf_frames->module~vkf_math module~vkf_pick vkf_pick module~vkf_frames->module~vkf_pick module~vkf