dule or program unit to \nmodules which it uses. Functions public  function arrow_create (base, direction, body_length, head_length, body_radius, head_radius, rgba, n_segments) result(mesh) An arrow mesh node (see arrow ) of color rgba , with 24 segments by\ndefault. Null on failure. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name real(kind=c_double), intent(in) :: base (3) real(kind=c_double), intent(in) :: direction (3) real(kind=c_double), intent(in) :: body_length real(kind=c_double), intent(in) :: head_length real(kind=c_double), intent(in) :: body_radius real(kind=c_double), intent(in) :: head_radius real(kind=c_float), intent(in), dimension(4) :: rgba color [r, g, b, a] (0 to 1) integer, intent(in), optional :: n_segments segments around (default 24, at least 3) Return Value type(c_ptr) public  function ellipsoid_create (radii, rgba, texture, n_lon, n_lat, night_texture, translucent) result(mesh) An ellipsoid mesh node with semi-axes radii (x, y, z) and color ( rgba ,\nmultiplying the texture), with an optional equirectangular texture and\nnight texture (image handles; the night texture shows where the light\nis weak). n_lon and n_lat default to 128 and 64 segments. With translucent , a translucent surface (its material's alpha; drawn after\nthe opaque scene, sorted by depth). Null on failure. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name real(kind=c_double), intent(in), dimension(3) :: radii semi-axes along x, y, z real(kind=c_float), intent(in), dimension(4) :: rgba color [r, g, b, a] (0 to 1) type(c_ptr), intent(in), optional :: texture image handle of the (day) texture integer, intent(in), optional :: n_lon segments in longitude (default 128) integer, intent(in), optional :: n_lat segments in latitude (default 64) type(c_ptr), intent(in), optional :: night_texture image handle of the night texture logical, intent(in), optional :: translucent a translucent surface (default false) Return Value type(c_ptr) public  function sphere_create (radius, rgba, texture, n_lon, n_lat) result(mesh) A sphere mesh node: ellipsoid_create with equal semi-axes. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name real(kind=c_double), intent(in) :: radius real(kind=c_float), intent(in), dimension(4) :: rgba color [r, g, b, a] (0 to 1) type(c_ptr), intent(in), optional :: texture image handle of the texture integer, intent(in), optional :: n_lon segments in longitude (default 128) integer, intent(in), optional :: n_lat segments in latitude (default 64) Return Value type(c_ptr) Subroutines public  subroutine arrow (base, direction, body_length, head_length, body_radius, head_radius, n_segments, xyz, normals, uv, indices) An arrow (OpenFrames' Vector: a cylinder body and a cone head) from base along direction : body of length body_length and radius body_radius , then a head of length head_length and base radius head_radius , closed at the bottom of the body and of the head, with n_segments around. Triangles are counter-clockwise seen from outside;\nindices are 0-based; uv is zero. Sizes are given by arrow_size . Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name real(kind=c_double), intent(in) :: base (3) real(kind=c_double), intent(in) :: direction (3) the arrow's axis (need not be unit length) real(kind=c_double), intent(in) :: body_length real(kind=c_double), intent(in) :: head_length real(kind=c_double), intent(in) :: body_radius real(kind=c_double), intent(in) :: head_radius integer, intent(in) :: n_segments real(kind=c_float), intent(out), dimension(:,:) :: xyz (3, n_vertices) real(kind=c_float), intent(out), dimension(:,:) :: normals (3, n_vertices) real(kind=c_float), intent(out), dimension(:,:) :: uv (2, n_vertices): zero integer(kind=c_int32_t), intent(out), dimension(:) :: indices (n_indices) public pure subroutine arrow_size (n_segments, n_vertices, n_indices) Number of vertices and triangle indices of arrow(..., n_segments, ...) . Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name integer, intent(in) :: n_segments segments around integer, i