 shows it and made again when a setting changes (also while\nshown; the new nodes are compiled and swapped in). Lines are vkframes'\ndouble-precision lines (widths in window units); tick marks are markers\n(MarkerArtist's shapes); surfaces are unlit and transparent, seen from both\nsides, and write no depth (as OpenFrames'), except a Polyhedron's when lit.\nSurfaces are made by one routine (surface_node), as their lines\n(line_node) and points (marker_node). Uses iso_c_binding vkf_math vkf_artists vkf_files iso_fortran_env vkf_layer vkf_frames module~~vkf_shapes~~UsesGraph module~vkf_shapes vkf_shapes iso_c_binding iso_c_binding module~vkf_shapes->iso_c_binding iso_fortran_env iso_fortran_env module~vkf_shapes->iso_fortran_env module~vkf_artists vkf_artists module~vkf_shapes->module~vkf_artists module~vkf_files vkf_files module~vkf_shapes->module~vkf_files module~vkf_frames vkf_frames module~vkf_shapes->module~vkf_frames module~vkf_layer vkf_layer module~vkf_shapes->module~vkf_layer module~vkf_math vkf_math module~vkf_shapes->module~vkf_math module~vkf_artists->iso_c_binding module~vkf_artists->module~vkf_frames module~vkf_artists->module~vkf_layer module~vkf_artists->module~vkf_math module~vkf_line_chain vkf_line_chain module~vkf_artists->module~vkf_line_chain module~vkf_pick vkf_pick module~vkf_artists->module~vkf_pick module~vkf_trajectory vkf_trajectory module~vkf_artists->module~vkf_trajectory module~vkf_frames->iso_c_binding module~vkf_frames->module~vkf_layer module~vkf_frames->module~vkf_math module~vkf_follower vkf_follower module~vkf_frames->module~vkf_follower module~vkf_geometry vkf_geometry module~vkf_frames->module~vkf_geometry module~vkf_frames->module~vkf_pick module~vkf_text vkf_text module~vkf_frames->module~vkf_text module~vkf_frames->module~vkf_trajectory module~vkf_layer->iso_c_binding module~vkf_math->iso_fortran_env module~vkf_follower->module~vkf_math module~vkf_follower->module~vkf_trajectory module~vkf_geometry->iso_c_binding module~vkf_geo