tices drawn (indices for indexed draws, times instances) Functions public  function library_versions () result(v) The versions of vkframes and the libraries it uses. Arguments None Return Value type( LibraryVersions ) private  function version_string (which) result(s) The rendering layer's version string which (see vkf_version), '' if unknown. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name integer, intent(in) :: which 1 VSG ... 5 the Vulkan loader Return Value character(len=:), allocatable","tags":"","url":"module/vkf_diagnostics.html"},{"title":"vkf_math – vkframes","text":"Math for vkframes: the working precision, quaternions and 4x4 transforms. Quaternions are q(4) = [x, y, z, w] (vector part first, as OpenFrames and\nOpenSceneGraph store them), unit length for rotations. The rotation of q\ntakes vectors in a frame to its parent frame: v_parent = rotate(q, v_local).\nMatrices are 4x4, column-major, acting on column vectors. Uses iso_fortran_env module~~vkf_math~~UsesGraph module~vkf_math vkf_math iso_fortran_env iso_fortran_env module~vkf_math->iso_fortran_env Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Module Module Submodule Submodule Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a submodule to the (sub)module which it is\ndescended from. Dashed arrows point from a module or program unit to \nmodules which it uses. Used by module~~vkf_math~~UsedByGraph module~vkf_math vkf_math module~vkf_artists vkf_artists module~vkf_artists->module~vkf_math module~vkf_frames vkf_frames module~vkf_artists->module~vkf_frames module~vkf_line_chain vkf_line_chain module~vkf_artists->module~vkf_line_chain module~vkf_pick vkf_pick module~vkf_artists->module~vkf_pick module~vkf_trajectory vkf_trajectory module~vkf_artists->module~vkf_trajectory module~vkf_clock vkf_clock module~vkf_clock->module~vkf_math module~vkf_diagnostics vkf_diagnostics module~vkf_diagnostics->module~vkf_ma